{"id":"forecast-03","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-03/audio-3.mp3","model":"small","duration":432.77,"segments":[{"start":0.02,"end":5.28,"text":"Part 3 You will hear two health science students called","words":[["Part",0.02,0.58],["3",0.58,1.08],["You",1.08,2.5],["will",2.5,2.68],["hear",2.68,2.98],["two",2.98,3.36],["health",3.36,3.74],["science",3.74,4.14],["students",4.14,4.7],["called",4.7,5.28]]},{"start":5.28,"end":10.64,"text":"Elliot and Beth discussing research on climate change and allergies.","words":[["Elliot",5.28,5.78],["and",5.78,6.2],["Beth",6.2,6.48],["discussing",6.48,7.56],["research",7.56,8.2],["on",8.2,8.64],["climate",8.64,9.04],["change",9.04,9.62],["and",9.62,9.98],["allergies.",9.98,10.64]]},{"start":11.96,"end":16.4,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 21 to 25.","words":[["First",11.96,12.76],["you",12.76,13.0],["have",13.0,13.18],["some",13.18,13.38],["time",13.38,13.8],["to",13.8,14.04],["look",14.04,14.18],["at",14.18,14.32],["questions",14.32,14.62],["21",14.62,15.46],["to",15.46,15.76],["25.",15.76,16.4]]},{"start":51.64,"end":55.98,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 25.","words":[["Now",51.64,52.14],["listen",52.14,52.52],["carefully",52.52,53.0],["and",53.0,53.34],["answer",53.34,53.78],["questions",53.78,54.18],["21",54.18,55.1],["to",55.1,55.34],["25.",55.34,55.98]]},{"start":59.68,"end":63.46,"text":"Have you had a chance to look at the information for our project yet, Beth?","words":[["Have",59.68,60.04],["you",60.04,60.26],["had",60.26,60.42],["a",60.42,60.5],["chance",60.5,60.82],["to",60.82,61.08],["look",61.08,61.26],["at",61.26,61.42],["the",61.42,61.52],["information",61.52,61.94],["for",61.94,62.34],["our",62.34,62.52],["project",62.52,62.92],["yet,",62.92,63.22],["Beth?",63.32,63.46]]},{"start":63.46,"end":69.06,"text":"I've had a look at most of the stuff on the relationship between climate change and allergies","words":[["I've",63.46,64.44],["had",64.44,64.58],["a",64.58,64.74],["look",64.74,64.88],["at",64.88,65.06],["most",65.06,65.32],["of",65.32,65.62],["the",65.62,65.78],["stuff",65.78,66.08],["on",66.08,66.28],["the",66.28,66.38],["relationship",66.38,67.0],["between",67.0,67.48],["climate",67.48,68.12],["change",68.12,68.42],["and",68.42,68.7],["allergies",68.7,69.06]]},{"start":69.82,"end":73.96,"text":"and the role played by pollen from flowering plants and trees.","words":[["and",69.82,70.22],["the",70.22,70.46],["role",70.46,70.8],["played",70.8,71.18],["by",71.18,71.54],["pollen",71.54,71.96],["from",71.96,72.34],["flowering",72.34,73.08],["plants",73.08,73.38],["and",73.38,73.66],["trees.",73.66,73.96]]},{"start":74.3,"end":81.68,"text":"Yeah, me too. The main message is that seasonal allergies seem to be getting worse. In just","words":[["Yeah,",74.3,74.66],["me",74.86,75.02],["too.",75.02,75.28],["The",76.02,76.24],["main",76.24,76.56],["message",76.56,77.04],["is",77.04,77.68],["that",77.68,77.92],["seasonal",77.92,78.38],["allergies",78.38,78.98],["seem",78.98,79.48],["to",79.48,79.62],["be",79.62,79.74],["getting",79.74,79.94],["worse.",79.94,80.4],["In",81.12,81.44],["just",81.44,81.68]]},{"start":81.68,"end":87.1,"text":"the last twenty years, the amount of pollen that's produced by the flowers on birch trees","words":[["the",81.68,81.88],["last",81.88,82.18],["twenty",82.18,82.5],["years,",82.5,83.26],["the",83.46,83.54],["amount",83.54,83.74],["of",83.74,84.04],["pollen",84.04,84.38],["that's",84.38,84.72],["produced",84.72,85.0],["by",85.0,85.36],["the",85.36,85.5],["flowers",85.5,85.9],["on",85.9,86.2],["birch",86.2,86.74],["trees",86.74,87.1]]},{"start":87.1,"end":94.24,"text":"allergies has tripled and one in four people suffers from either hay fever or asthma which","words":[["allergies",87.1,87.24],["has",87.24,87.72],["tripled",87.72,88.42],["and",88.42,89.02],["one",89.02,89.36],["in",89.36,89.7],["four",89.7,90.08],["people",90.08,90.52],["suffers",90.52,90.98],["from",90.98,91.5],["either",91.5,91.88],["hay",91.88,92.18],["fever",92.18,92.52],["or",92.52,93.18],["asthma",93.18,93.58],["which",93.58,94.24]]},{"start":94.24,"end":95.26,"text":"is triggered by pollen.","words":[["is",94.24,94.38],["triggered",94.38,94.7],["by",94.7,94.94],["pollen.",94.94,95.26]]},{"start":95.88,"end":101.56,"text":"I read something about allergy sufferers being more likely to have a vitamin D deficiency","words":[["I",95.88,96.32],["read",96.32,96.52],["something",96.52,96.92],["about",96.92,97.28],["allergy",97.28,97.8],["sufferers",97.8,98.4],["being",98.4,98.72],["more",98.72,99.08],["likely",99.08,99.48],["to",99.48,99.8],["have",99.8,100.08],["a",100.08,100.24],["vitamin",100.24,100.54],["D",100.54,101.02],["deficiency",101.02,101.56]]},{"start":102.12,"end":107.18,"text":"because we no longer take cod liver oil as a vitamin supplement like many people used","words":[["because",102.12,102.48],["we",102.48,102.66],["no",102.66,102.84],["longer",102.84,103.18],["take",103.18,103.46],["cod",103.46,103.72],["liver",103.72,103.9],["oil",103.9,104.26],["as",104.26,104.54],["a",104.54,104.62],["vitamin",104.62,104.92],["supplement",104.92,105.44],["like",105.44,106.1],["many",106.1,106.5],["people",106.5,106.86],["used",106.86,107.18]]},{"start":107.18,"end":114.22,"text":"to do in the 1950s in Britain and since then allergies have quadrupled in most European","words":[["to",107.18,107.38],["do",107.38,107.56],["in",107.56,107.7],["the",107.7,107.82],["1950s",107.82,108.9],["in",108.9,109.04],["Britain",109.04,109.3],["and",109.3,110.5],["since",110.5,110.86],["then",110.86,111.22],["allergies",111.22,111.96],["have",111.96,112.24],["quadrupled",112.24,113.04],["in",113.04,113.38],["most",113.38,113.74],["European",113.74,114.22]]},{"start":114.22,"end":120.82,"text":"in countries. But it was only in Britain that cod liver oil was so popular, so that argument","words":[["in",114.22,114.36],["countries.",114.36,114.8],["But",115.54,115.9],["it",115.9,116.12],["was",116.12,116.28],["only",116.28,116.58],["in",116.58,116.78],["Britain",116.78,117.14],["that",117.14,117.5],["cod",117.5,117.78],["liver",117.78,117.94],["oil",117.94,118.22],["was",118.22,118.5],["so",118.5,118.68],["popular,",118.68,119.12],["so",119.54,119.88],["that",119.88,120.36],["argument",120.36,120.82]]},{"start":120.82,"end":122.24,"text":"doesn't really make sense.","words":[["doesn't",120.82,121.38],["really",121.38,121.66],["make",121.66,121.94],["sense.",121.94,122.24]]},{"start":122.5,"end":124.6,"text":"No, it doesn't seem that relevant.","words":[["No,",122.5,122.88],["it",123.38,123.56],["doesn't",123.56,123.84],["seem",123.84,124.04],["that",124.04,124.2],["relevant.",124.2,124.6]]},{"start":125.42,"end":130.54,"text":"What seems to be happening now is that an increasing number of people are getting their first","words":[["What",125.42,125.74],["seems",125.74,125.98],["to",125.98,126.16],["be",126.16,126.28],["happening",126.28,126.6],["now",126.6,127.1],["is",127.1,127.8],["that",127.8,127.94],["an",127.94,128.08],["increasing",128.08,128.54],["number",128.54,128.96],["of",128.96,129.12],["people",129.12,129.44],["are",129.44,129.64],["getting",129.64,129.84],["their",129.84,130.18],["first",130.18,130.54]]},{"start":130.54,"end":132.96,"text":"attack in their 40s and 50s.","words":[["attack",130.54,131.08],["in",131.08,131.42],["their",131.42,131.58],["40s",131.58,132.2],["and",132.2,132.28],["50s.",132.28,132.96]]},{"start":133.1,"end":139.84,"text":"That must be because of the link with climate change causing rising temperatures. But CO2","words":[["That",133.1,133.74],["must",133.74,133.98],["be",133.98,134.22],["because",134.22,134.46],["of",134.46,134.68],["the",134.68,134.82],["link",134.82,135.1],["with",135.1,135.48],["climate",135.48,135.9],["change",135.9,136.34],["causing",136.34,136.88],["rising",136.88,137.4],["temperatures.",137.4,138.06],["But",138.86,139.12],["CO2",139.12,139.84]]},{"start":139.84,"end":142.68,"text":"levels are seriously affecting pollen counts too.","words":[["levels",139.84,140.28],["are",140.28,140.46],["seriously",140.46,140.96],["affecting",140.96,141.58],["pollen",141.58,141.98],["counts",141.98,142.42],["too.",142.42,142.68]]},{"start":142.68,"end":144.88,"text":"as much as milder winters.","words":[["as",142.68,143.4],["much",143.4,143.72],["as",143.72,143.96],["milder",143.96,144.46],["winters.",144.46,144.88]]},{"start":145.18,"end":145.6,"text":"Definitely.","words":[["Definitely.",145.18,145.6]]},{"start":146.5,"end":149.02,"text":"CO2 helps stimulate plant growth","words":[["CO2",146.5,147.28],["helps",147.28,147.66],["stimulate",147.66,148.2],["plant",148.2,148.68],["growth",148.68,149.02]]},{"start":149.02,"end":151.76,"text":"and several recent studies have shown","words":[["and",149.02,149.8],["several",149.8,150.3],["recent",150.3,150.74],["studies",150.74,151.24],["have",151.24,151.5],["shown",151.5,151.76]]},{"start":151.76,"end":154.92,"text":"that when plants are exposed to more CO2","words":[["that",151.76,152.04],["when",152.04,152.26],["plants",152.26,152.9],["are",152.9,153.14],["exposed",153.14,153.48],["to",153.48,153.9],["more",153.9,154.26],["CO2",154.26,154.92]]},{"start":154.92,"end":156.5,"text":"they produce more pollen.","words":[["they",154.92,155.52],["produce",155.52,155.84],["more",155.84,156.18],["pollen.",156.18,156.5]]},{"start":156.9,"end":157.4,"text":"Really?","words":[["Really?",156.9,157.4]]},{"start":158.12,"end":159.98,"text":"So people might experience more","words":[["So",158.12,158.36],["people",158.36,158.64],["might",158.64,158.9],["experience",158.9,159.52],["more",159.52,159.98]]},{"start":159.98,"end":162.26,"text":"severe allergic symptoms in future?","words":[["severe",159.98,160.44],["allergic",160.44,160.92],["symptoms",160.92,161.42],["in",161.42,161.86],["future?",161.86,162.26]]},{"start":162.54,"end":162.98,"text":"That's right.","words":[["That's",162.54,162.72],["right.",162.72,162.98]]},{"start":163.5,"end":163.84,"text":"Hmm.","words":[["Hmm.",163.5,163.84]]},{"start":164.34,"end":166.02,"text":"And another factor is that the pollen","words":[["And",164.34,164.52],["another",164.52,164.78],["factor",164.78,165.18],["is",165.18,165.4],["that",165.4,165.56],["the",165.56,165.7],["pollen",165.7,166.02]]},{"start":166.02,"end":167.06,"text":"season is changing.","words":[["season",166.02,166.44],["is",166.44,166.64],["changing.",166.64,167.06]]},{"start":167.4,"end":167.7,"text":"Yes.","words":[["Yes.",167.4,167.7]]},{"start":168.22,"end":170.12,"text":"Scientists are predicting spring","words":[["Scientists",168.22,168.8],["are",168.8,169.24],["predicting",169.24,169.58],["spring",169.58,170.12]]},{"start":170.12,"end":177.42,"text":"will come five weeks earlier by 2130. That's in the long term, but that doesn't mean","words":[["will",170.12,170.4],["come",170.4,170.7],["five",170.7,171.24],["weeks",171.24,171.94],["earlier",171.94,172.38],["by",172.38,172.94],["2130.",172.94,173.94],["That's",174.4,174.94],["in",174.94,175.06],["the",175.06,175.14],["long",175.14,175.48],["term,",175.48,175.84],["but",176.28,176.62],["that",176.62,176.96],["doesn't",176.96,177.22],["mean",177.22,177.42]]},{"start":177.42,"end":183.78,"text":"that spring will come earlier every year. Look at last winter, that was really cold until","words":[["that",177.42,177.58],["spring",177.58,177.96],["will",177.96,178.22],["come",178.22,178.44],["earlier",178.44,178.86],["every",178.86,179.36],["year.",179.36,179.78],["Look",180.18,180.52],["at",180.52,180.7],["last",180.7,181.04],["winter,",181.04,181.46],["that",181.94,182.18],["was",182.18,182.34],["really",182.34,182.86],["cold",182.86,183.38],["until",183.38,183.78]]},{"start":183.78,"end":190.58,"text":"March and the pollen season was delayed, whereas this year spring came earlier and lasted","words":[["March",183.78,184.26],["and",184.26,185.06],["the",185.06,185.22],["pollen",185.22,185.48],["season",185.48,185.84],["was",185.84,186.06],["delayed,",186.06,186.56],["whereas",187.02,187.46],["this",187.46,187.94],["year",187.94,188.3],["spring",188.3,188.86],["came",188.86,189.16],["earlier",189.16,189.64],["and",189.64,190.12],["lasted",190.12,190.58]]},{"start":190.58,"end":193.84,"text":"longer. Right, and another thing we should mention","words":[["longer.",190.58,190.88],["Right,",191.14,191.5],["and",192.14,192.44],["another",192.44,192.82],["thing",192.82,193.12],["we",193.12,193.32],["should",193.32,193.48],["mention",193.48,193.84]]},{"start":193.84,"end":198.3,"text":"is ragweed. As an example of a plant species moving","words":[["is",193.84,194.22],["ragweed.",194.22,194.88],["As",195.32,195.78],["an",195.78,195.96],["example",195.96,196.46],["of",196.46,196.74],["a",196.74,196.9],["plant",196.9,197.14],["species",197.14,197.58],["moving",197.58,198.3]]},{"start":198.3,"end":201.56,"text":"into new areas as a result of climate change.","words":[["into",198.3,198.62],["new",198.62,198.96],["areas",198.96,199.46],["as",199.46,200.0],["a",200.0,200.12],["result",200.12,200.42],["of",200.42,200.8],["climate",200.8,201.14],["change.",201.14,201.56]]},{"start":201.86,"end":208.78,"text":"Yes. In the US it's already the major allergen, affecting millions of people in August and","words":[["Yes.",201.86,202.18],["In",202.68,203.06],["the",203.06,203.2],["US",203.2,203.56],["it's",203.56,204.06],["already",204.06,204.5],["the",204.5,204.74],["major",204.74,205.12],["allergen,",205.12,205.68],["affecting",205.98,206.46],["millions",206.46,207.0],["of",207.0,207.38],["people",207.38,207.72],["in",207.72,208.04],["August",208.04,208.44],["and",208.44,208.78]]},{"start":208.78,"end":214.56,"text":"September. But we're starting to see it grow in Europe for the first time, which is really","words":[["September.",208.78,209.22],["But",209.66,210.08],["we're",210.08,210.4],["starting",210.4,210.66],["to",210.66,210.9],["see",210.9,211.12],["it",211.12,211.26],["grow",211.26,211.52],["in",211.52,211.78],["Europe",211.78,212.18],["for",212.18,212.42],["the",212.42,212.52],["first",212.52,212.84],["time,",212.84,213.34],["which",213.7,213.96],["is",213.96,214.16],["really",214.16,214.56]]},{"start":214.56,"end":216.8,"text":"worrying because it's so allergenic.","words":[["worrying",214.56,215.08],["because",215.08,215.44],["it's",215.44,215.8],["so",215.8,215.98],["allergenic.",215.98,216.8]]},{"start":217.1,"end":222.8,"text":"The problem with tree pollen is also worse in cities because there are so many hard","words":[["The",217.1,217.64],["problem",217.64,218.04],["with",218.04,218.34],["tree",218.34,218.68],["pollen",218.68,219.02],["is",219.02,219.62],["also",219.62,219.9],["worse",219.9,220.26],["in",220.26,220.56],["cities",220.56,221.0],["because",221.0,221.5],["there",221.5,221.82],["are",221.82,221.94],["so",221.94,222.2],["many",222.2,222.4],["hard",222.4,222.8]]},{"start":222.8,"end":228.24,"text":"surfaces around, and the pollen doesn't get absorbed so much, just stays in the air.","words":[["surfaces",222.8,223.34],["around,",223.34,223.78],["and",224.3,224.52],["the",224.52,224.68],["pollen",224.68,224.94],["doesn't",224.94,225.42],["get",225.42,225.52],["absorbed",225.52,225.98],["so",225.98,226.3],["much,",226.3,226.64],["just",226.8,227.08],["stays",227.08,227.68],["in",227.68,227.88],["the",227.88,228.02],["air.",228.02,228.24]]},{"start":228.44,"end":232.84,"text":"Yeah. Wasn't the pollen shown to be three times higher in one city?","words":[["Yeah.",228.44,228.78],["Wasn't",229.46,229.88],["the",229.88,230.02],["pollen",230.02,230.24],["shown",230.24,230.52],["to",230.52,230.72],["be",230.72,230.88],["three",230.88,231.22],["times",231.22,231.72],["higher",231.72,232.12],["in",232.12,232.38],["one",232.38,232.56],["city?",232.56,232.84]]},{"start":233.08,"end":239.38,"text":"I think so. So because of this, many cities have started to ban the planting of certain","words":[["I",233.08,233.32],["think",233.32,233.58],["so.",233.58,233.88],["So",234.6,234.98],["because",234.98,235.3],["of",235.3,235.62],["this,",235.62,235.98],["many",236.3,236.46],["cities",236.46,236.78],["have",236.78,237.04],["started",237.04,237.48],["to",237.48,237.72],["ban",237.72,238.04],["the",238.04,238.24],["planting",238.24,238.7],["of",238.7,239.02],["certain",239.02,239.38]]},{"start":239.38,"end":240.18,"text":"types of trees.","words":[["types",239.38,239.72],["of",239.72,239.86],["trees.",239.86,240.18]]},{"start":243.72,"end":250.06,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the discussion, you have some time to look at questions 26-30.","words":[["Before",243.72,244.22],["you",244.22,244.48],["hear",244.48,244.78],["the",244.78,245.0],["rest",245.0,245.28],["of",245.28,245.44],["the",245.44,245.5],["discussion,",245.5,245.94],["you",246.56,246.78],["have",246.78,247.0],["some",247.0,247.2],["time",247.2,247.64],["to",247.64,247.9],["look",247.9,248.06],["at",248.06,248.2],["questions",248.2,248.58],["26",248.58,249.48],["-30.",249.48,250.06]]},{"start":275.41,"end":279.01,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 26-30.","words":[["Now",275.41,275.71],["listen",275.71,276.03],["and",276.03,276.47],["answer",276.47,276.95],["questions",276.95,277.39],["26",277.39,278.41],["-30.",278.41,279.01]]},{"start":279.01,"end":288.45,"text":"So, shall we look at the different data tables for seasonal changes for pollen in Europe?","words":[["So,",279.01,280.05],["shall",283.07,283.39],["we",283.39,283.61],["look",283.61,283.89],["at",283.89,284.17],["the",284.17,284.33],["different",284.33,284.65],["data",284.65,284.99],["tables",284.99,285.59],["for",285.59,286.03],["seasonal",286.03,286.55],["changes",286.55,287.11],["for",287.11,287.61],["pollen",287.61,287.97],["in",287.97,288.19],["Europe?",288.19,288.45]]},{"start":288.85,"end":293.89,"text":"OK, but I think we should just focus on the trees and plants which we have the most data","words":[["OK,",288.85,289.15],["but",289.61,289.79],["I",289.79,290.15],["think",290.15,290.37],["we",290.37,290.57],["should"