g to compare with","words":[["I",317.73,317.87],["wonder",317.87,318.09],["why",318.09,318.31],["there's",318.31,318.51],["no",318.51,318.65],["data",318.65,318.91],["for",318.91,319.19],["oak",319.19,319.43],["or",319.43,319.65],["grass.",319.65,319.99],["Hmm.",320.49,320.87],["It",321.45,321.61],["would",321.61,321.71],["be",321.71,321.85],["interesting",321.85,322.29],["to",322.29,322.59],["compare",322.59,323.09],["with",323.09,323.49]]},{"start":323.49,"end":325.39,"text":"neighbouring countries. True.","words":[["neighbouring",323.49,324.23],["countries.",324.23,324.65],["True.",325.05,325.39]]},{"start":326.05,"end":331.77,"text":"The picture in France is unusual. Yes. The pollen season starts earlier for both","words":[["The",326.05,326.41],["picture",326.41,326.77],["in",326.77,327.03],["France",327.03,327.43],["is",327.43,327.71],["unusual.",327.71,328.09],["Yes.",328.47,328.81],["The",329.35,329.49],["pollen",329.49,329.79],["season",329.79,330.19],["starts",330.19,330.61],["earlier",330.61,331.17],["for",331.17,331.49],["both",331.49,331.77]]},{"start":331.77,"end":337.75,"text":"both oak and birch, but it doesn't start any earlier for grass. I wonder why that is?","words":[["both",331.77,331.91],["oak",331.91,332.23],["and",332.23,332.81],["birch,",332.81,333.43],["but",333.71,333.95],["it",333.95,334.13],["doesn't",334.13,334.57],["start",334.57,334.85],["any",334.85,335.11],["earlier",335.11,335.33],["for",335.33,335.59],["grass.",335.59,335.91],["I",336.69,336.85],["wonder",336.85,337.03],["why",337.03,337.23],["that",337.23,337.37],["is?",337.37,337.75]]},{"start":338.69,"end":343.11,"text":"In the Netherlands, we've got complete data for all three plants.","words":[["In",338.69,339.05],["the",339.05,339.17],["Netherlands,",339.17,339.67],["we've",340.17,340.67],["got",340.67,340.87],["complete",340.87,341.53],["data",341.53,341.95],["for",341.95,342.19],["all",342.19,342.47],["three",342.47,342.67],["plants.",342.67,343.11]]},{"start":343.43,"end":